{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A granddaughter. A lifetime of memories. A story woven through the objects left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong>, you play as Meredith Carter, returning to her late grandmother\u2019s home to sort through a lifetime of belongings.<br>Each item holds echoes of Margaret &quot;Peggy&quot; Carter\u2019s life, shaped by war, love, hardship, and hope across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven walking simulator without combat or puzzles. Instead, you engage with letters, journals, and keepsakes to uncover deeply personal stories from 1940 to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong> offers a quiet and reflective journey about memory, loss, and the enduring ties that connect generations.<br>It is brought to life through immersive voice acting, atmospheric visuals, and historically inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will launch on May 16, 2025.<br>Add it to your Wishlist and discover the memories left behind.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Roots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668830/e895cd0c5abc87200a44b894a368bb4c0cc28442.jpg"},{"name":"Toward the Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668830/5b326921949218a460da256d003a71405d9753a5.jpg"},{"name":"Healing Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668830/6654c9a762d6cd91165b9c69539d269842aff04c.jpg"},{"name":"Reconnected Bonds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668830/358b0261e8887621c669746e6ab93462510e6fb1.jpg"},{"name":"Rebuilding Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668830/5e5ec9a47bb5762958e5e94d0308fbc988ca4c8c.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/